# Mobile-First and Reuse-First

- Start layout for mobile, then enhance with `md`, `lg`, `xl`.
- Avoid desktop-only assumptions (hover-only actions, oversized fixed blocks).
- Extract repeated sections into reusable components.
- Keep media blocks adaptive for portrait/landscape/square assets.
- Prefer semantic HTML and accessible controls.

## Quick Example

```tsx
// ✅ mobile-first classes
<div className="grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2 xl:grid-cols-3" />
```
